From 51e9a1d7db32d723dcbb4e2bf0730524de18933d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 19:24:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tracing): add trace_ignore_status_codes option

Add a `trace_ignore_status_codes` option that lists HTTP status codes
(or inclusive `[min, max]` ranges) of incoming requests that should not
be traced. When a sampled transaction finishes and its
`http.response.status_code` data matches an entry, the transaction is
marked as not sampled and is not sent.

The default is an empty list, so existing behavior is unchanged.

Resolves #1913
